Metric:
- id: process.automation.coverage
- name: Process Automation Coverage
- description: Process Automation Coverage measures the proportion of enterprise workflows that have been automated compared to those that still require manual intervention. This metric identifies specific areas within HR, ERP, and ITSM processes where automation is currently implemented and highlights workflows that remain reliant on human input. By analyzing this coverage, organizations can pinpoint inefficiencies and prioritize automation initiatives to enhance operational efficiency. The scope includes all relevant workflows across departments, ensuring a comprehensive view of automation adoption. Ultimately, this metric serves as a strategic tool for driving digital transformation and optimizing resource allocation.

