Metric:
- id: workflow.sla_adherence
- name: Workflow SLA Adherence
- description: Workflow SLA Adherence measures the extent to which operational workflows comply with predefined Service Level Agreements (SLAs). This metric evaluates the timeliness and efficiency of processes within ERP, HR, and ITSM systems, ensuring that tasks are completed within the agreed-upon timeframes. By tracking adherence to SLAs, organizations can identify delays and violations that may indicate potential operational risks. The metric encompasses all critical workflows, including those related to service requests, incident resolution, and employee onboarding. Monitoring this adherence helps organizations maintain service quality and improve overall process performance.

