Metric:
- id: q2c.throughput
- name: Quote-to-Cash Throughput
- description: Quote-to-Cash Throughput measures the efficiency and speed of the entire quote-to-cash process, which encompasses all steps from generating a sales quote to receiving payment for goods or services. This metric evaluates how quickly an organization can convert a customer inquiry into actual revenue, highlighting the effectiveness of workflows, controls, and automation within the sales and finance functions. It captures the time taken at each stage, including quoting, order processing, invoicing, and payment collection. By analyzing this throughput, organizations can identify bottlenecks and streamline operations to enhance overall revenue realization. Ultimately, this metric serves as a critical indicator of operational performance and customer satisfaction in the sales cycle.

