Metric:
- id: ai.penetration
- name: AI Penetration
- description: AI Penetration measures the degree to which artificial intelligence technologies are integrated into various enterprise workflows, including ERP, HR, and ITSM processes. This metric assesses both the depth of AI utilization within specific functions, such as predictive analytics in HR recruitment or automated ticketing in ITSM, and the breadth of AI application across different business domains. By evaluating the extent of AI adoption, organizations can identify areas of strength and opportunities for further enhancement. The metric also highlights the diversity of AI tools employed, ranging from machine learning algorithms to natural language processing systems. Ultimately, AI Penetration provides insights into how effectively an organization leverages AI to improve operational efficiency and decision-making.

