- description: The AI Outcome Uplift metric quantifies the positive impact of artificial intelligence interventions on key business outcomes, specifically focusing on efficiency gains, revenue enhancements, and improvements in customer experience (CX). This metric measures the extent to which AI-driven processes, such as automation of workflows or predictive analytics, contribute to achieving better performance compared to traditional methods. It encompasses various domains, including ERP systems for operational efficiency, HR systems for talent management, and ITSM for service delivery improvements. By isolating the effects of AI, organizations can assess the return on investment and strategic value of their AI initiatives. The metric serves as a critical tool for decision-makers to evaluate the effectiveness of AI applications in driving business transformation.

