Metric:
- id: ai.governance_coverage
- name: AI Governance Coverage
- description: AI Governance Coverage measures the extent to which an organization has established and implemented governance policies related to artificial intelligence. This includes evaluating the presence of ethical guidelines, compliance frameworks, and monitoring mechanisms that ensure responsible AI usage. The metric identifies gaps in safeguards that protect against biases, data privacy violations, and other ethical concerns. It also assesses the alignment of AI initiatives with regulatory requirements and industry standards. By flagging missing safeguards, this metric helps organizations enhance their AI governance framework, ensuring that AI systems operate transparently and responsibly.

